            "Wet cement, skin, eye, wash water, and hygiene controls verified",
            "Silica, cutting, grinding, chipping, dust, and respiratory routes addressed",
            "Vehicle, backing, delivery, spotter, public, and struck-by zones controlled",
            "Electrical tools, vibrators, cords, GFCI, and wet locations controlled",
            "Heat, cold, lighting, fatigue, weather, and emergency route reviewed",
            "Cure, open edges, floor openings, loading, and access restrictions posted"
